          "index": 0,
          "role": "user",
          "content": "I'm working on a note-taking app. I'd rather keep the UI minimal. The app must support Markdown. What's the best way to sync notes between devices?"
        },
        {
          "id": "conv_98cb1511aeca8cbc_t1",
          "index": 1,
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "You could use CRDTs. See [Automerge](https://automerge.org/) and https://crdt.tech for background.\n\n```js\nconst doc = Automerge.init();\n```"
        },
        {
          "id": "conv_98cb1511aeca8cbc_t2",
          "index": 2,
          "role": "user",
          "content": "Let's use Automerge. Please implement a sync prototype. Avoid any paid services."
        }
